            <ArticleTitle>Improved perioperative management: the preoperative contribution.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>130-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The preoperative evaluation should focus on clinical history and be used to establish a database. In patients at moderate clinical risk undergoing high-risk procedures, noninvasive testing should be considered if it modifies care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
